          <p data-facetest-camera-error-message>No pudimos acceder a tu cámara.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold" data-facetest-retry-camera>
              Reintentar
